      "message": "Starting with sshd 2.18.0, mina-sshd\u0027s ML-KEM hybrid key exchanges (mlkem768x25519, mlkem768nistp256, mlkem1024nistp384) moved from BC\u0027s experimental org.bouncycastle.pqc.crypto.mlkem.* package to the stabilized org.bouncycastle.crypto.{params,generators,kems}.MLKEM* API, which only exists from BC 1.84 onward. On BC 1.83 those classes aren\u0027t present, so mina-sshd\u0027s own isSupported() check quietly disables the three algorithms — but KeyExchangePolicy declares them as required/unsuppressed, so AlgoCoverageTest/BuiltinCoverageTest fail with \"Unimplemented algorithms\"/\"Unused SSHD builtins\" for the mlkem entries.\n\nNeeds a bouncycastle.version o(≥1.84) alongside the mina-sshd bump. That has been delivered in odlparent 14.3.6, not adopted yet.",
